      en: ["Located on East Bank Demerara near Georgetown.", "Center for food processing and manufacturing.", "Major hub for oil and gas sector service providers.", "Specifically promoted by the government for local business.", "Excellent connectivity to the Demerara River port.", "One of the fastest-growing industrial estates in the country."],
